{"type":"data","nodes":[{"type":"data","data":[{"translations":1},{"cs":2,"en":62},{"site.tagline":3,"nav.home":4,"nav.docs":5,"nav.examples":6,"nav.playground":7,"nav.github":8,"nav.npm":9,"nav.language":10,"lang.en":11,"lang.cs":12,"lang.de":13,"banner.v3":14,"error.title":15,"error.404":16,"error.default":17,"error.home":18,"playground":19},"Internacionalizace pro SvelteKit","Domů","Dokumentace","Příklady","Hřiště","GitHub","npm","Jazyk","English","Čeština","Deutsch","Toto je dokumentace k v3. Pro řadu v2 se podívej na větev {{branch}}.","Něco se pokazilo","Tato stránka neexistuje.","Došlo k neočekávané chybě.","Zpět na úvodní stránku",{"title":7,"lead":20,"source":21,"output":22,"parser":23,"preprocess":35,"loaders":41,"fallback":57},"Každý panel níže řídí skutečnou instanci přes veřejné API. Změň vstup a knihovna odpoví — nic tady není nahrávka.","Zobrazit kód","Výstup",{"title":24,"lead":25,"format":26,"flavour":27,"message":32,"payload":33,"locale":10,"silent":34},"Formáty zpráv","Jádro samo žádný formát zpráv nemá: slot vyplňuje parser. Curly přichází s tímto balíčkem; ICU, MessageFormat 2 a i18next jsou alternativy postavené přímo na jádře.","Formát zprávy",{"curly":28,"icu":29,"mf2":30,"i18next":31},"Curly","ICU","MessageFormat 2","i18next","Zpráva","Data","Žádná hlášení. Hlášení nikdy nevyhodí výjimku — placeholder vezme svou náhradu a zbytek zprávy se vyhodnotí.",{"title":36,"lead":37,"input":38,"mode":39,"note":40},"Předzpracování","Z vnořených překladů se stávají ploché klíče, které čte t(). Jak daleko se zajde, určuje režim.","Překlady","Režim","rawTranslations drží vstup tak, jak přišel; translations je to, co vidíš tady.",{"title":42,"lead":43,"locale":10,"route":44,"load":45,"invalidate":46,"reset":47,"empty":48,"shape":49,"status":53},"Loadery","Loader se spustí, když sedí jeho jazyk i jeho routes na aktuální route, jednou za okno čerstvosti. Načti stejnou route dvakrát a sleduj, jak druhý pokus neudělá nic.","Route","Načíst překlady","Invalidovat","Reset","Vyber jazyk a route, pak načti.",{"every":50,"exact":51,"pattern":52},"bez routes — každá route","řetězec — přesná shoda","vzor — celá sekce",{"ran":54,"cached":55,"skipped":56},"spustil se","už načteno","neodpovídá",{"title":58,"lead":59,"key":60,"note":61},"Záložní jazyk","Klíč, který aktivní jazyk nemá, se vyhodnotí přes fallbackLocale, místo aby zůstal prázdný.","Klíč","Zálohují se jen chybějící klíče. Co vykreslí klíč chybějící všude, určuje fallbackValue.",{"site.tagline":63,"nav.home":64,"nav.docs":65,"nav.examples":66,"nav.playground":67,"nav.github":8,"nav.npm":9,"nav.language":68,"lang.en":11,"lang.cs":12,"lang.de":13,"banner.v3":69,"error.title":70,"error.404":71,"error.default":72,"error.home":73,"playground":74},"Internationalization for SvelteKit","Home","Documentation","Examples","Playground","Language","This is the documentation for v3. For the v2 line, see the {{branch}} branch.","Something went wrong","This page does not exist.","An unexpected error occurred.","Back to the homepage",{"title":67,"lead":75,"source":76,"output":77,"parser":78,"preprocess":87,"loaders":93,"fallback":107},"Every panel below drives a real instance through the public API. Change an input and the library answers — nothing here is a recording.","Show the code","Output",{"title":79,"lead":80,"format":81,"flavour":82,"message":83,"payload":84,"locale":85,"silent":86},"Message formats","The core holds no message format of its own: a parser fills the slot. Curly comes with this package; ICU, MessageFormat 2 and i18next are the alternatives, on the core directly.","Message format",{"curly":28,"icu":29,"mf2":30,"i18next":31},"Message","Payload","Locale","No reports. A report never raises — the placeholder takes its fallback and the rest of the message resolves.",{"title":88,"lead":89,"input":90,"mode":91,"note":92},"Preprocessing","Nested translations become the flat keys t() reads. The mode decides how far that goes.","Translations","Mode","rawTranslations keeps the input as it arrived; translations is what you see here.",{"title":94,"lead":95,"locale":85,"route":44,"load":96,"invalidate":97,"reset":47,"empty":98,"shape":99,"status":103},"Loaders","A loader runs when its locale matches and its routes match the current route, once per freshness window. Load the same route twice and watch the second attempt do nothing.","Load translations","Invalidate","Pick a locale and a route, then load.",{"every":100,"exact":101,"pattern":102},"no routes — every route","a string — exact match","a pattern — a whole section",{"ran":104,"cached":105,"skipped":106},"ran","already loaded","did not match",{"title":108,"lead":109,"key":110,"note":111},"Fallback locale","A key the active locale does not carry resolves through fallbackLocale instead of rendering empty.","Key","Only the missing keys fall back. What a key missing everywhere renders as is fallbackValue."],"uses":{"url":1}},{"type":"data","data":[{"code":1},{"parser":2,"preprocess":7,"loaders":11,"fallback":12},{"curly":3,"icu":4,"mf2":5,"i18next":6},"\u003Cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { I18n } \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'sveltekit-i18n'\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i18n\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =\u003C/span>\u0